    "detailed_description": "Hey, you! Do you like to bounce balls with your friends? Of course it is!<br><br>Our small studio fully supports you in your desire. We want to make the game of our dreams that we would like to play ourselves.<br><br><strong>Hitting Balls</strong> - Versus arena shooter for 4 players. Challenge your friends and prove that you are the best!<br><br>In early access you will have access to:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> 20 interesting levels;<br></li><li> 10 different weapons;<br></li><li> Several types of grenades;<br></li><li> Character customization;<br></li><li> Advanced destructibility;<br></li><li> balls</li></ul><br>You will also be able to participate in the development process by joining our Telegram group or Discord server.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play Fun!</h2>",
